/**
 * Raised when a Verdict names a Transfer ID the table has no row for.
 *
 * <p>Carries the ID on {@link hu.bankmonitor.payments.accounts.UnknownAccountException}'s
 * precedent, because the answer owed to whoever reported the Verdict has to name what was
 * not found. Which status code that becomes, and under which problem type URN, belongs to
 * the endpoint in ticket 21.
